Z||000006||Rodrv6||06-24-2001||02:12 PM||||Since you mentioned that the lights don't come on when the doors are opened, it sounds like either all the bulbs are blown or there is a power or ground problem in the circuit somewhere. If you have an 84 and it doesn't have the optional "conveniance light" package, then you won't have lights under the dash by the kick panels.  Those bulbs are also prone to getting kicked by feet, so they may not be there.  <p>[This message has been edited by Rodrv6 (edited 06-24-2001).]||||reg||1
